Farmer's Delight for Horizon 26.3 (version 0.5.0)

A port of Farmer's Delight 1.20.1-2.4.1+refabricated by vectorwing, MehVahdJukaar, MerchantPug.
Original source: https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/FarmersDelight
Original licence: MIT

Ported to Horizon by lavoide: the rules are re-implemented in Rust on Horizon's mod API, and the
content (items, blocks, textures, models, data) is carried over from the original jar. This port is
distributed under the same licence as the original (MIT); the licence text is in LICENSE. Built
against Horizon's exact-build SDK dd67b76ff23e28c6d8e21859df600d31572f81a0.
